      "path": "tasks/archive/tasks_verified_5_yet.jsonc",
      "instruction": "Could you open the DOL FLSA Overtime Calculator Advisor. Enter a nonexempt employee with weekly salary $900.00 covering 46.00 hours. Copy the regular rate and overtime calculation into Spreadsheet. Set `Regular Rate` to `=Salary/Hours`, `Overtime Hours` to `=MAX(Hours-40,0)`, `Additional Overtime Premium` to `=ROUND(RegularRate*0.5*OvertimeHours,2)`, and `Total FLSA Pay` to `=ROUND(Salary+AdditionalOvertimePremium,2)`. Save `~/Documents/dol_overtime_017.txt` using the calculator and spreadsheet results in the format 'Scenario: Fixed weekly salary $900.00 covering 46.00 hours | Regular Rate: [value] | Overtime Hours: [value] | Additional Overtime Premium: [value] | Total FLSA Pay: [value]'."
