    "source": {
      "task_id": "web_sheet_prozilla_juso_09",
      "path": "tasks/archive/tasks_verified_5_yet.jsonc",
      "instruction": "Could you open Juso address search at https://www.juso.go.kr/. Search for `울산광역시 남구 중앙로 201`. Select the first result whose road address contains `울산광역시` and \"남구\", `중앙로`, and building number `201`. Copy the postal code, road address, and jibun address if shown. Record them in Spreadsheet columns Search Query, Postal Code, Road Address, and Jibun Address. Set `Zip Prefix` to `=LEFT(B2,2)` and `Road Keyword` to `중앙로`, and `Address Check` to `=IF(AND(ISNUMBER(SEARCH(\"울산광역시\",C2)),ISNUMBER(SEARCH(\"중앙로\",C2)),ISNUMBER(SEARCH(\"201\",C2))),\"MATCH\",\"CHECK\")`. Save `~/Documents/juso_address_009.txt` in the format 'Scenario: 울산광역시청 address lookup | Search Query: 울산광역시 남구 중앙로 201 | Postal Code: [value] | Road Address: [value] | Jibun Address: [value] | Zip Prefix: [value] | Road Keyword: 중앙로 | Address Check: [value]'."
    },
