    "source": {
      "task_id": "web_sheet_prozilla_nhis_02",
      "path": "tasks/archive/tasks_verified_5_yet.jsonc",
      "instruction": "Could you open NHIS workplace eligibility simulation and enter business registration number 1111111111. Set both employment pay status and workplace enrollment status to eligible so final result is positive. In Spreadsheet, set A1:C2 with A1='사업자번호', B1='최종판정', C1='판정값', and A2='1111111111', then record the simulator's final message in B2 and a pass flag derived from that result in C2. In Prozilla OS, create ~/Documents/finance_report.txt and write the simulator result and derived flag in the format 'Final Result: [value]', 'Pass Flag: [value]'."
    },
    "source_answer_state": [],
    "seed_status": "todo",
