    "group": "C",
    "source": {
      "task_id": "web_sheet_prozilla_nhis_04",
      "path": "tasks/archive/tasks_verified_5_yet.jsonc",
      "instruction": "Could you open NHIS regional premium simulation and set inputs: domestic selected, 사업소득 등=30000, 주택=100000, others empty/default. Calculate the displayed 예상 지역보험료. In Spreadsheet, set A1:B4 with A1='항목', B1='값', A2='예상지역보험료', A3='검증', and A4='천원단위', then record the displayed premium in B2, set B3 to a verification flag after checking that value, and set B4 to '=ROUND(B2/1000,0)'. In Prozilla OS, create ~/Documents/finance_report.txt and write the results in the format 'Expected Local Premium: [value]원' and 'Verification: [value]'."
