    "source": {
      "task_id": "web_sheet_prozilla_nhis_05",
      "path": "tasks/archive/tasks_verified_5_yet.jsonc",
      "instruction": "Could you open NHIS late fee simulation and set inputs: premium=100005, member type domestic(including workplace), insurance type health, notice month=202407, payment due date=20250424. Calculate the displayed 예상 연체금 and 연체일수. In Spreadsheet, set A1:B4 with A1='항목', B1='값', A2='연체금', A3='연체일수', and A4='1일당', then record the displayed late fee in B2 and the displayed overdue days in B3, and set B4 to '=ROUND(B2/B3,2)'. In Prozilla OS, create ~/Documents/finance_report.txt and write the results in the format 'Late Fee: [value]원', 'Days: [value]일', and 'Verification: PASS'."
